{%- doc -%}
  Inner HTML for one tab panel. Section wraps with .tab-content and .rte.

  @param {number} tab_index - 1–4
  @param {string} content - richtext from section settings
{%- enddoc -%}

{% liquid
  assign has_custom = false
  if content != blank
    assign stripped = content | strip
    if stripped != blank
      assign has_custom = true
    endif
  endif
%}

{% if has_custom %}
  {{ content }}
{% else %}
  {% case tab_index %}
    {% when 1 %}
      <p>
        Make a bold visual statement at your next trade show, expo, or promotional event with our Premium Straight
        Tension Fabric Backdrop Display. This display is perfect for exhibitors, event planners, and brands that want
        high-impact visuals with a hassle-free setup. Featuring dye-sublimation printing on wrinkle-resistant
        polyester fabric, it delivers vibrant colors, crisp details, and a professional presentation every time.
        Lightweight yet durable, it’s the ideal choice for trade show booths, media walls, conference backdrops, and
        branded environments.
      </p>
      <h4>📏 Product Specifications</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Frame:</strong> Durable aluminum bungee-corded frame with wide aluminum bases (32mm diameter)</li>
        <li><strong>Fabric:</strong> 260gsm wrinkle-resistant, fire-retardant, and machine-washable polyester</li>
        <li><strong>Print Method:</strong> Full-color CMYK dye-sublimation for rich, lasting prints</li>
        <li><strong>Setup Time:</strong> Fast tool-free assembly using snap-lock tube connectors</li>
        <li><strong>Use Cases:</strong> Ideal for expos, press events, retail stores, lobbies, and photography backdrops</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>🎯 Key Features</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Vibrant, high-resolution graphics with eco-friendly dye sublimation printing</li>
        <li>Wrinkle-resistant, fire-retardant, and machine washable fabric</li>
        <li>Lightweight aluminum frame ensures portability and strength</li>
        <li>Quick and tool-free setup using snap-lock connectors</li>
        <li>Available in single or double-sided print options</li>
        <li>Optional add-ons: LED lights, hard carry cases, counters, and accessories</li>
      </ul>
      <h4>🌍 Shipping &amp; Installation</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Production Lead Time:</strong> 24 business hours after artwork approval</li>
        <li><strong>Domestic Shipping:</strong> Delivered in 5–7 business days across the IND.</li>
        <li><strong>International Shipping:</strong> Available with customs-ready support</li>
        <li><strong>Pickup Services:</strong> Not available — all items are shipped</li>
        <li><strong>Installation:</strong> Optional professional setup available on request</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Assembly Video:</strong>
          <a href="https://youtu.be/jJGLLSZJZvg?feature=shared" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch on YouTube</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    {% when 2 %}
      <p>
        Size : 2m wide :<br>
        Frame dimension : 2m wide x 2.3m height<br>
        Graphic Dimension : 2030mm wide x 2280mm height<br>
        Package Dimension : 27 cm x 27 cm x 76 cm<br>
