      </p>
      <p>
        Size: 2.4m Wide:<br>
        Frame Dimensions : 2.4m wide x 2.3m height<br>
        Graphics Dimension : 2438mm wide x 2280mm height<br>
        Package Dimension : 27 cm x 27 cm x 76 cm<br>
        Package Weight : 5.3kgs
      </p>
      <p>
        Size: 3m Wide:<br>
        Frame Dimensions : 3m wide x 2.3m height<br>
        Graphics Dimension : 2922mm wide x 2280mm height<br>
        Package Dimension : 27 cm x 27 cm x 76 cm<br>
        Package Weight : 7.5kgs
      </p>
      <p>
